{title: Christ Receiveth Sinful Men}
{artist: Erdmann Neumeister · tr. Emma Bevan}
{key: G}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[G]Sinners Jesus [C]will re[G]ceive: sound this word of [D]grace to all
[G]who the heavenly [C]pathway [G]leave, all who linger, [D]all who [G]fall.

Chorus
Sing it [G]o'er and [D]o'er a[Em]gain: [C]Christ re[G]ceiveth [D]sinful men;
[G]make the [B]message [Em]clear and [C]plain: [G]Christ re[D]ceiveth [G]sinful men.
